==English==
{{wikipedia}}

===Etymology===
''Cease'' essentially meaning "stop", and ''desist'' meaning "do not do it again."

===Verb===
{{head|en|verb|head=to [[cease]] [[and]] [[desist]]}}

# {{idiomatic|legal}} To stop and to not resume an action.

